          "text": "Lino bantu ba-Kiriyati-Jearimu bakasika, bakatansika ibbokesi lyaJehova, bakalileta kuŋanda ya-Abinadabu mucilundu, Nkabela mwa­ naakwe Eleazeri bakamusalazya kuti alindile ibbokesi lya-Jehova.",
