        {
          "text": "Lino kuzwa kubuzuba obo mbulyakakala ibbokesi mu-Kiriyati-Jearimu ciindi cakalampa, cakasika kumyaaka iili makumi obile. Nkabela luzubo loonse lwa-Israyeli lwakali kuya bulilila Jehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
