        {
          "text": "Lino Samuele wakaambila luzubo loonse lwa-Israyeli wati, Kuti mwapiluka kuli-Jehova camoyo woonse, amugwisye mizimo myeenzu kuzwa mukati kanu, abalo ba-Astoreti amubagwisye. Amubambe myoyo yanu kuli-Jehova, mumanine nguwe luzutu milimo, kuti amuvune kuzwa mumaanza aaba-Filisti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
