        {
          "text": "Lino Samuele wakabweza kabelele komwe kanyonka, wakakatuula koonse mbuli cituuzyo kuli-Jehova. Nkabela Samuele wakakumbilila Israyeli kuli-Jehova, alakwe Jehova wakamuvwiila,",
          "type": "text",
